        "language": "english",
        "review": "I've only just cracked open the first bit of it, but I wanted to let people know that [i]X.E.H.A. Rogue[/i] is very intriguing!\n\nThe characters are quirky, and the writing has this wonderful terse, snappy style. Nothing and no one wastes your time—this is VN done right!\n\nThe art is charming. The locations are evocative, and the portraits are the best ever from Corvaena. The typography is unique, and I have grown to adore the font. The whole VN looks proper and is nicely legible on my small 15\" laptop. The audio is serviceable.\n\nThis is a very high quality visual novel. If you're on the fence about this one, take the plunge! I'm enjoying it.🙂",
